# pnpm-lock.yaml is COMMITTED. This is a deployed service, not a published
# library: the lockfile is what makes a rebuild months from now install the
# same tree as today, and the Dockerfile installs with --frozen-lockfile.
#
# It was ignored (inherited from a library template), which meant CI could not
# install at all -- ERR_PNPM_NO_LOCKFILE -- while the Pi built fine, because
# the deploy tarball carries untracked files and git does not.
!pnpm-lock.yaml